# 🏥 HealthPulse — Implementation Plan

## Overview

**Project:** Voice-enabled, AI-driven health assistant  
**Architecture:** Monorepo (backend + frontend in one root)  
**Team Split:**  
- **You (Backend):** Node.js + Express + TypeScript, Gemini API, VOSK, Supabase  
- **Friend (Frontend):** React 18 + Vite + TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion  

---

